  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Alumni Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to further strengthen (young) entrepreneurs &#x2013; that have successfully concluded an Orange Corners (OC) incubation and/or acceleration programme, i.e. OC alumni &#x2013; through follow-up support. To unlock their full potential,  Orange Corners alumni could significantly benefit from tailored and additional support, as sustained commitment is an important ingredient when aiming to contribute to healthy and growing companies, that create decent jobs, and have a sustainable impact.</narrative>
  </description>
